 and battles powerful enemies to solve problems occurring around the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for easy play even for players unfamiliar with action games, the game features a simple yet challenging gameplay balance.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A key feature is Mina's &quot;Costume Changes,&quot; which change her appearance and available skills, adding a strategic element to the gameplay by allowing players to choose an outfit that suits the situation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045490/extras/992f6a6c6fc83765cccf4210195de709.avif?t=1770241113\" width=920 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition, there are a wide variety of emotes, and the camera position can be freely adjusted, allowing you to view Mina's adorable appearance from any angle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045490/extras/4c8e00df541c9f30455f2c89ca4d9149.avif?t=1770241113\" width=920 height=430 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25a0Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is structured into stages. Players progress through maps filled with various gimmicks and enemies. Defeating the boss at the end of each stage completes that stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045490/extras/3685e8f8da3534cc44f5a41aaf17737d.avif?t=1770241113\" width=920 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The difficulty of the map gimmicks and enemies increases as the stage progresses, with the final boss being particularly powerful. Even if a boss is formidable in a normal battle, you should be able to defeat it if you can skillfully exploit its weak points!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045490/extras/07e8b65d8d006d9e3eea5813894d65a3.avif?t=1770241113\" width=920 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game will be cleared once all stages are cleared, but for players who aren't satisfied with just that, there are also several EX stages. The bosses in the EX stages are infinitely stronger than the bosses that came before, so those who want to fully experience the game should aim to defeat all of the EX bosses.</p>","developers":["SENKO"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4045490/b460ff858da660633ef7f9189d21ec32f111f3db/header.jpg?t=1770241113","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4045490/915330277/b4d5f475668917392a7209a0c8f9dd9f3086e0d6/1758891473/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759539318","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4045490/915330277/b4d5f475668917392a7209a0c8f9dd9f3086e0d6/1758891473/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759539318","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4045490/915330277/b4d5f475668917392a7209a0c8f9dd9f3086e0d6/1758891473/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759539318","id":257206860,"name":"MagicalGirlMina_PV_1_En","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_it